{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mechanis Obscura</i> is a <strong>first-person escape-room thriller</strong> where puzzles, live-action sequences, and psychological horror collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged into a secret <strong>deep-web abduction trial</strong>, you must face unseen rules and shifting realities inside a twisted mansion of gears and shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Adventure</strong> \u2013 Explore a mansion of gears, locks, and deadly contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Atmospheric tension inspired by early 2000\u2019s underground horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-Action Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Full-motion video woven into gameplay for a chilling, cinematic feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Web &amp; Abduction Themes</strong> \u2013 Discover how you were taken, and why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Logic-driven challenges that test perception as much as intellect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every corridor hides secrets; every choice carries consequence.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018410?t=1757750159","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/0dc7d355eefd054499989decf05b39d7b12205c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757750159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/46e759b739c5fa07273f9e07405c047f10300a12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757750159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/46e759b739c5fa07273f9e07405c047f10300a12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757750159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements and depictions of violence. \r\nScenes may include blood, unsettling imagery, and instances where characters are harmed \r\nby mechanical parts. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mechanis Obscura</i> is a <strong>first-person escape-room thriller</strong> where puzzles, live-action sequences, and psychological horror collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged into a secret <strong>deep-web abduction trial</strong>, you must face unseen rules and shifting realities inside a twisted mansion of gears and shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Adventure</strong> \u2013 Explore a mansion of gears, locks, and deadly contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Atmospheric tension inspired by early 2000\u2019s underground horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-Action Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Full-motion video woven into gameplay for a chilling, cinematic feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Web &amp; Abduction Themes</strong> \u2013 Discover how you were taken, and why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Logic-driven challenges that test perception as much as intellect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every corridor hides secrets; every choice carries consequence.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Konstantinos Klimantakis"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/351d59aef2c550a2713c880da970049e